  "description": "An interactive diagram control for .NET MAUI - hierarchies, decision trees, flowcharts and mindmaps. Bindable shapes and connections, tidy tree / layered / mindmap / radial / force-directed auto-layout, straight, orthogonal and bezier connectors anchored to real shape outlines, pan, zoom, marquee selection, node dragging, connection authoring and undo.",
